  <QuestId>k__BackingField: northern-walks-record
  speaker: Merchant
  title: Recover the Northern Walks record
  destinationId: 
  Puzzle:
    rid: 5555647664672473498
  coinReward: 25
  arrivalRadius: 3
  offer:
  - The archive is also reconstructing incompatible biological and mechanical records.
    Recover the Northern Walks record to find out why the process is continuing.
  - Bring the final reference record back here. Your delivery will provide the last
    verification needed for Old Arts, along with your next weapon and 25 coins.
  inProgress:
  - That explains the Residues. The System Garden Tower record shows how the archive
    joined living things to machinery from other periods. Recover the Northern Walks
    record so we can find out why it keeps going.
  - Bring the final record back. I'll verify it for access to Old Arts and issue
    your next weapon and 25 coins.
  readyToTurnIn:
  - You have the final record. Submit it for verification and collect your weapon
    and 25 coins. Once verified, access to Old Arts will be authorised.
  completed:
  - All three records are verified. Every repair creates another conflict, so the
    central corrective system starts again. It'll keep rebuilding the campus until
    someone stops it.
  - You're cleared to enter Old Arts. Reach the central corrective system and shut
    it down so we can begin the recovery.
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 5555647664672473498
